<title>USA: ONBANCorp holder proposes sale or merger.</title>
<headline>ONBANCorp holder proposes sale or merger.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ONBANCorp Inc said Wednesday that Seymour Holtzman, the bank's largest individual shareholder, proposed a merger or the sale of the bank to a stronger financial institution.</p>
<p>In a news release Wednesday, ONBANCorp said that Holtzman requested the shareholder list and was considering nominating five outside directors with a mandate to sell the Syracuse, N.Y.-based bank.</p>
</text>
